<a href=\"/\" class=\"nav__link nav__link--secondary\">Home</a>\n        <a href=\"/about\" class=\"nav__link nav__link--secondary\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"/treatments\" class=\"nav__link\">Services</a>\n        <a href=\"/devices\" class=\"nav__link is-active\">Devices</a>\n        <a href=\"/results\" class=\"nav__link\">Before &amp; After</a>\n        <a href=\"/faq\" class=\"nav__link nav__link--secondary\">FAQ</a>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"nav__link\">Visit us</a>\n        <a href=\"/book\" class=\"btn btn--gold nav__menu-book\">Book appointment</a>\n      </nav>\n      <div class=\"language-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Website language\" data-i18n-ignore>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-language=\"en\" lang=\"en\" aria-pressed=\"true\">English</button><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><button type=\"button\" data-language=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" aria-pressed=\"false\">العربية</button>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"/book\" class=\"nav__cta\" data-open-booking>Book appointment</a>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"nav__burger\" id=\"burger\" data-i18n-live aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"navLinks\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n    <section class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/devices\">Devices</a> · <span>Cutera</span></nav>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Cutera at Soie Clinic · Cairo, Egypt</p>\n        <h1 class=\"page-hero__title\">Cutera excel HR<br /><em>laser hair removal in Cairo.</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"page-hero__lede\">Explore laser hair removal with Cutera excel HR at Soie Clinic in Cairo. Watch our device in use and learn how skin, hair and treatment area guide the session plan.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section device-section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"device-feature device-feature--film\">\n          <div class=\"device-video__player\" id=\"cutera-video\">\n            <video class=\"film device-video__media\"\n              muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\"\n              poster=\"/assets/videos/posters/cutera-excel-hr.jpg\"\n              data-film data-src=\"/assets/videos/cutera-excel-hr.mp4\"\n              width=\"720\" height=\"1280\"\n              aria-label=\"Cutera excel HR device at Soie Clinic\"></video>\n            <button class=\"film-toggle\" type=\"button\" data-media-toggle aria-label=\"Pause video\" aria-pressed=\"false\"></button>\n            <noscript><p><a href=\"/assets/videos/cutera-excel-hr.mp4\">Watch the Cutera video</a></p></noscript>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"device-feature__body\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Available at Soie Clinic</p>\n            <h2>Two wavelengths.<br /><em>Chosen for your treatment.</em></h2>\n            <p>Our Cutera excel HR device has 755 nm and 1064 nm wavelength options. We assess your skin, hair and treatment area before choosing the settings.</p>\n            <p>Watch the clips below for a look at our Cutera device and its treatment controls.</p>\n            <div class=\"device-tags\"><span>755 nm</span><span>1064 nm</span><span>Personalised laser care</span></div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn--gold\" data-open-booking>Ask about Cutera</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"device-topics\">\n          <article><span class=\"eyebrow\">01 / Hair</span><h2>Hair reduction</h2><p>Ask about laser hair reduction for the face or body. We will discuss the area, session spacing and likely number of visits after assessing your skin and hair.</p></article>\n          <article><span class=\"eyebrow\">02 / Skin</span><h2>Skin revitalisation</h2><p>Talk to our team about your skin concern. We can explain which treatments are available with this device and whether one suits your needs.</p></article>\n          <article><span class=\"eyebrow\">03 / Your plan</span><h2>Assessment comes first</h2><p>Tell us about recent sun exposure, medicines and previous treatments. This helps us advise you on preparation, timing and aftercare.</p></article>\n        </div>\n        <section class=\"device-faq\" id=\"device-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"cutera-faq-title\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Before your visit</p>\n          <h2 id=\"cutera-faq-title\">Cutera, <em>explained.</em></h2>\n          <details><summary>Does Soie Clinic have a Cutera device?</summary><p>Yes. We have a Cutera excel HR device at Soie Clinic in Cairo. Contact us before visiting to confirm the branch and available appointments.</p></details>\n          <details><summary>Which Cutera device is featured here?</summary><p>This is Cutera excel HR, with 755 nm and 1064 nm wavelength options. Both clips were filmed at Soie Clinic.</p></details>\n          <details><summary>How many Cutera sessions will I need?</summary><p>It depends on your skin, hair, treatment area and goals. We will suggest a schedule after your assessment and review how you respond.</p></details>\n          <details><summary>How do I book a Cutera consultation?</summary><p>Message our team with the treatment or concern you would like to discuss. We will confirm the branch and help you arrange a consultation.</p></details>\n\n          <details><summary>How much does Cutera laser hair removal cost?</summary><p>The price depends on the area being treated and your session plan. Ask Soie Clinic for current prices and branch availability after discussing your skin and hair with our team.</p></details>\n        </section>\n        <aside class=\"device-source\">\n          <h2>Explore the technology</h2>\n          <p>Read Cutera's overview of skin revitalisation and resurfacing. Ask our team which of these treatments are available with the device at our clinic.</p>\n          <a href=\"https://cutera.com/us-en/treatments/skin-revitalization-and-resurfacing-solutions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Explore Cutera’s official treatment information ↗</a>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section cta-band\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2 class=\"cta-band__title\">Considering Cutera?<br /><em>Talk to our team.</em></h2>\n        <p class=\"cta-band__sub\">Contact us to discuss your skin or hair concern and arrange a consultation at the right branch.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta-band__actions\"><button class=\"btn btn--gold btn--lg\" data-open-booking>Ask about Cutera</button><a class=\"btn btn--ghost btn--lg\" href=\"/devices\">Explore our devices</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n<aside class=\"device-related container\" aria-labelledby=\"related-title\"><h2 id=\"related-title\">Other devices at Soie Clinic</h2><div class=\"device-related__links\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/devices/indiba-deep-care\">INDIBA Deep Care <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/devices/finexel-fractional-co2\">FineXel CO2 <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/devices\">Browse all devices <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div></aside>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container signature-footer-cta\"><h2>Your next step starts here.</h2><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"/book\" data-open-booking>Book appointment <svg class=\"btn__arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hid